00:05:34.990 --> 00:05:37.330
We spent a lot of time
divining these models

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:39.220
with the headphones on.

00:05:39.220 --> 00:05:43.550
But there is a real improvement
and difference that you can--

00:05:43.550 --> 00:05:46.000
a real improvement
in quality that you

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:49.450
can measure in some ways
that we will see later.

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:51.320
With respect to parametric,
the difference--

00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:53.060
it's much more clear.

00:05:53.060 --> 00:05:57.400
I think it will be evident
