00:37:14.760 --> 00:37:15.600
The business trends.

00:37:15.600 --> 00:37:18.240
So what's happening is barriers
to entry have fallen away.

00:37:18.240 --> 00:37:20.400
So several years
ago, if you wanted

00:37:20.400 --> 00:37:22.125
to print your book,
your own memoir,

00:37:22.125 --> 00:37:24.120
