00:39:28.860 --> 00:39:31.410
And of those, 181 million read.

00:39:31.410 --> 00:39:33.300
So it's interesting.

00:39:33.300 --> 00:39:36.220
What we're seeing is that
books in any format-- about 74%

00:39:36.220 --> 00:39:37.470
