text-to-speech resonate.

00:41:18.799 --> 00:41:20.590
There are a few things
to think about here.

00:41:20.590 --> 00:41:23.330
First of all, obviously, the
success around text to speech--

00:41:23.330 --> 00:41:24.300
as you've heard--

00:41:24.300 --> 00:41:27.840
has to do with understandability
and the ability

00:41:27.840 --> 00:41:29.340
to sound natural.

00:41:29.340 --> 00:41:31.800
In the past, when we've
heard text-to-speech,

00:41:31.800 --> 00:41:34.380
we've heard very
robotic attempts.

00:41:34.380 --> 00:41:37.560
And Bell Labs and
MIT have been working

00:41:37.560 --> 00:41:39.630
