00:41:39.630 --> 00:41:41.160
But what Google
is doing is really

00:41:41.160 --> 00:41:43.580
uncovering that
natural language sound.

00:41:43.580 --> 00:41:46.390
And so we're very
excited about that.

00:41:46.390 --> 00:41:50.010
Well, we believe that book
discoverability is critical.

00:41:50.010 --> 00:41:57.690
And in fact, Gartner says that
about 30% of all search in 2020

00:41:57.690 --> 00:41:59.010
is going to be done via voice.

00:41:59.010 --> 00:42:00.510
So it's going to be screenless.

00:42:00.510 --> 00:42:02.968
So that's really important as
we think about enhancing book

00:42:02.968 --> 00:42:04.969
discoverability and so forth.

